/tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017958D00" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017958F60"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000179591C0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017959420" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000179598D0"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017959B30"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017959D90"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017959FF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795A820"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795AA80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi all,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795AF40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795B1A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795B660"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795B8C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please note that there is a&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795BB20">Live Issue</strong>&nbsp;with Tech Partner:&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795BEB0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">XXX</strong>&nbsp;that has been logged around <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">XXX</span>. The distribution team is currently working to resolve this.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000179583C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795C240">If you receive enquiries from your accounts, please advise them that we are actively working towards a solution.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795C480"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795C590">For immediate departures within 72&nbsp;hours, please contact the Qantas Agency Connect team directly. Otherwise, please await further updates. The QAC website will be continuously updated with the latest status.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000180445A0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018041180">All QAC and Sales Support teams are requested to review the policy on live issues and departures within 72&nbsp;hours and take the appropriate action as specified in the policy.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795D330"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795D440">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795D680"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795D790"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001795D9D0">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9D160"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9D3A0">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9D990"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9DBF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9E0B0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9E310" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017B9FDE0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017BA0040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); l